@startuml

' ===== 字体与样式设置（确保论文打印清晰） =====
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontName SimHei
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participantPadding 25
skinparam sequenceBoxBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam noteBorderColor #666666

' ===== 参与者定义 =====
actor "用户" as User
participant "用户信息页" as UserPage
participant "UserController" as Controller
participant "UserService" as Service
participant "UserMapper" as Mapper
participant "MySQL数据库" as DB

' ===== 前置条件说明 =====
note over User, UserPage
  <b>前置条件：</b>管理员已完成登录并携带有效Token
end note

' ===== 核心流程：分页查询用户信息 =====
autonumber 1
User -> UserPage: 访问用户信息页面
activate UserPage

autonumber 2
UserPage -> Controller: GET /user/list?loginName=xxx&page=1&size=10
activate Controller

autonumber 3
Controller -> Service: list(UserQueryReq)
activate Service

autonumber 4
Service -> Service: 创建 UserExample 查询条件

autonumber 5
Service -> Service: PageHelper.startPage(page, size)

autonumber 6
Service -> Mapper: selectByExample(userExample)
activate Mapper

autonumber 7
Mapper -> DB: 执行分页查询（COUNT + SELECT LIMIT）
activate DB
DB --> Mapper: 返回用户数据列表
DB --> Mapper: 返回总条数 total
deactivate DB

autonumber 8
Mapper --> Service: 返回 List<User>
deactivate Mapper

autonumber 9
Service -> Service: PageInfo 封装分页信息

autonumber 10
Service -> Service: CopyUtil.copyList 转换为 UserQueryResp

autonumber 11
Service -> Service: 关联查询 role 表填充 roleName

autonumber 12
Service --> Controller: 返回 PageResp(list, total, pages)
deactivate Service

autonumber 13
Controller --> UserPage: 返回 JSON 分页响应
note right
  {
    "content": {
      "total": 10,
      "list": [...],
      "pages": 1
    }
  }
end note
deactivate Controller

autonumber 14
UserPage --> User: 渲染用户信息表格+分页组件
deactivate UserPage

' ===== 底部说明 =====
note over Service, Mapper
  <b>分页机制：</b>PageHelper 拦截 SQL，自动追加 LIMIT 和 COUNT
  <b>字段映射：</b>CopyUtil.copyList 将 User 实体转为 UserQueryResp
  <b>角色关联：</b>遍历 list 查询 role 表填充 roleName
end note

note over UserPage, Controller
  <b>RBAC 权限控制：</b>仅管理员角色（perRoleId=1）可进入用户管理页面，
  前端通过菜单显隐控制，后端接口不做二次角色校验。
end note

@enduml
